From 7a0d1f2d4c2cce8f0ad329e75acb28b6cc876865 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lance <lance@local>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:05:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add DLSS input hook for OptiScaler DLSS-NR (DX12 route)

Urban makes no upscaler call, so OptiScaler has nothing to intercept. This
adds that call: a native NVNGX DLSS DLAA dispatch at present time on the
DX12 GS device (dlssnr=1 also switches the Bridge from DX11 to DX12), with
config plumbing ([Video] DlssNr) and the install side (OptiScaler.ini
template, runtime-file installer, docs/DLSSNR.md). Depth and motion
vectors are v1 placeholders (constant depth, zero MV); see docs/DLSSNR.md.
